{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free demo lets you experience the console version of <i>Neffy -Moonlight Labyrinth X-</i>.<br>Switch between two modes: guiding Neffy through the maze in back view, or solving tricks from the hero Nova\u2019s perspective.<br><br>The demo includes a tutorial stage designed to introduce the adventure.<br>On touch-supported devices, you can interact directly with Neffy and the maze for intuitive play.<br><br>\u203bThe trial version playtime is approximately 10 minutes.<br><i>Save data from the demo cannot be carried over to the full version.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/e6cf8362272fe9ff0248bd5460dfea77.avif?t=1760576956\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/189c2bb7e10b49ab4a53d871bd3014cb.poster.avif?t=1760576956\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/189c2bb7e10b49ab4a53d871bd3014cb.webm?t=1760576956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/189c2bb7e10b49ab4a53d871bd3014cb.mp4?t=1760576956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Neffy -Moonlight Labyrinth X-</i></strong> is an action puzzle game where you team up with the young shrine maiden Neffy to solve riddles and overcome traps in a fantasy maze.  <br>Originally developed for VR, the game has been carefully optimized for consoles\u2014now more accessible than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/67d823db32d1eaca3ee5976c6e3512f7.avif?t=1760576956\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/3f8b3f8d61747bcb9eafea8d2331e546.avif?t=1760576956\" width=837 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019ll switch between the \u201cNovalis perspective\u201d and the \u201cNeffy perspective\u201d as you progress through the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the \u201cNovalis perspective\u201d to activate heavy mechanisms or to transform Neffy into a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need to explore hidden paths that are hard to see from Novalis\u2019s viewpoint, switch to the \u201cNeffy perspective\u201d to discover new routes and delve deeper into the labyrinth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/d50725148a7ea8408867a729c37882c4.avif?t=1760576956\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/8ca77b6e31d3335261fa9a97f845b481.avif?t=1760576956\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Novalis, a powerful summoned being who helps Neffy by manipulating gigantic mechanisms and unlocking sealed paths with the power of moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/d2cd23179fb8236f8e3391e8e8dbfb15.avif?t=1760576956\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with Neffy to support her: transforming her into a cat, healing her, or triggering adorable reactions. <br>Neffy is fully voiced by Shiori Izawa (English version: Diana Garnet), adding warmth and personality to every encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Connect with Neffy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/3cbd8559423cab6e9dfdabf3afcd5e88.poster.avif?t=1760576956\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/3cbd8559423cab6e9dfdabf3afcd5e88.webm?t=1760576956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform into a Black Cat</strong> <br>Touch Neffy to help her become a cat\u2014boosting her jump and agility!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/a7b96905376e5a66dd787107aa46dd8d.poster.avif?t=1760576956\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/a7b96905376e5a66dd787107aa46dd8d.webm?t=1760576956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heal Her Wounds</strong> <br>A gentle touch restores her strength and keeps her going.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/189c2bb7e10b49ab4a53d871bd3014cb.poster.avif?t=1760576956\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/189c2bb7e10b49ab4a53d871bd3014cb.webm?t=1760576956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/189c2bb7e10b49ab4a53d871bd3014cb.mp4?t=1760576956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Reactions</strong> <br>Neffy responds with cute voice lines and animations when touched.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/8f50049156ffe3f3cc068609f38e2c7d.avif?t=1760576956\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/35a9f61d2b40a4452ec34dc5e66c16fd.avif?t=1760576956\" width=676 height=407 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >touchscreen-supported devices, you can directly pet Neffy and interact with mechanisms for a more intuitive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988110/extras/bb9589a23a0b6b2178082b3a455d1cff.avif?t=1760576956\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988110?t=1760576956","background_raw":"https://shared.akama